ity Concerns**: The growing backlog and high average resolution time suggest capacity issues.\n\n**Recommendation**:\n- Re-evaluate team workload distribution to ensure balanced workloads.\n- Consider hiring additional resources or re-allocating existing ones to critical areas.\n\n## General Process Efficiency Improvements\n- Implement automated workflows for routine tasks to free up team capacity.\n- Use data-driven insights to continuously refine and improve processes.\n- Foster a culture of continuous improvement and encourage team feedback on process inefficiencies."
